flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Open COLORS Website]
    B --> C[Enter Username and Password]
    C --> D{Are Credentials Valid?}

    D -->|No| E[Display Login Error]
    E --> C

    D -->|Yes| F{Is User Administrator?}

    F -->|Yes| G[Access Administrator Functions]
    G --> H[Create New User Account]
    H --> I[Save Account to Database]
    I --> J[Display Confirmation]
    J --> K([End])

    F -->|No| L[Access COLORS Application]
    L --> M{Choose an Operation}

    M -->|Add Color| N[Enter Color Name]
    N --> O[Submit Color]
    O --> P{Is Input Valid?}
    P -->|No| Q[Display Error Message]
    Q --> N
    P -->|Yes| R[Save Color to Database]
    R --> S[Display Success Message]
    S --> M

    M -->|Search Colors| T[Enter Search Term]
    T --> U[Query Database]
    U --> V{Matching Colors Found?}
    V -->|Yes| W[Display Matching Colors]
    V -->|No| X[Display No Results Message]
    W --> M
    X --> M

    M -->|Logout| Y[End User Session]
    Y --> K